[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    35[0m:[38;5;10m[49m * `priority`: any `int`, incl. `0`, `-1`, `INT_MIN`, `INT_MAX`.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    36[0m:[38;5;10m[49m * task count vs capacity: 0, 1, `max_tasks-1`, `max_tasks`, `max_tasks+k`.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    37[0m:[38;5;10m[49m * `driver` blob shape (`driver.c:45-66`): empty, no trailing `\n`, trailing `\n`,
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    38[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   only `\n`, leading `\n`, consecutive `\n\n` (empty lines *are* tasks), a single
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    39[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   line, many lines, more lines than capacity, lines longer than 255.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    40[0m:[38;5;10m[49m * Ordering/state: log before/after `initialize_logger`, repeated
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    41[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   create/destroy, `print_tasks` on a partially filled array.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    42[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
